  "title": "Lisa H NDE 3520",
  "date": "1998",
  "content": "I remember being in and out of consciousness, trying to look around to see what was going on, until I slipped into almost a peaceful sleep, I was not afraid or worried. I saw a very bright light all around me; it was beautiful. I saw what seemed to me as angel wings around me, I could not make out any faces, just knew they were there. One that really stood out to me was an angel so bright that was right in front of me, she had on an African necklace. What seemed to me standing there with her a very long time, which actually was only a few minutes, but her necklace is what continues to this day to stand out to me. I came around and the lady that was there with me was crying and told me what had happened. I had a tear come out of my eye but was not afraid at all, I kept reassuring her that I was okay.",
